name objective-until-past-timeout-1
timeout 300

# MUST NOT PARSE. `until <s>` declares the span an objective is judged over (doc/missions/verdict.md,
# "The seventh thing in the vocabulary"). A span at or past the mission timeout can never close, so the
# objective would silently be judged at the end of the run — the exact rule the modifier exists to
# replace, wearing a new word. The parser refuses it and prints both numbers.
# Required outcome: exit 1, RESULT result=FAIL reason="parse: line 15: 'objective ... until 300' is at
# or past the mission timeout (300.000000 s): a span that cannot close is the old end-of-run rule
# wearing a new word". See ./README.md.

unit viper
  module f16
  spawn 46.73202 6.73455 2500 48.0 300
  objective survive until 300
